---
// OfficialSourcesSection.astro - Transparansi & Validitas Sumber Data Resmi Real-Life
---

<section class="my-14 bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-keraton-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Header Bar -->
  <div class="bg-keraton-900 text-white p-6 sm:p-8 border-b-2 border-jogja-400">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-keraton-950 text-jogja-300 border border-jogja-400 mb-3">
        EVALUASI FAKTUAL &amp; TRANSPARANSI REGULASI
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
        Transparansi Sumber Data Resmi &amp; Regulasi Real-Life
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-keraton-100/90 leading-relaxed">
        Seluruh data tarif, lintasan koridor, jam operasional, dan simpul transit yang disajikan di <strong>PanduanRuteJogja.com</strong> dihimpun secara objektif dari dokumen regulasi pemerintah serta observasi fisik berkala di lapangan.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 bg-paper-50/40">
    
    <!-- 5 Pilar Institusi SSOT Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
      
      <!-- Sumber 1: Dishub DIY -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs hover:border-keraton-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 border border-blue-200">
            REGULATOR DAERAH
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">PERGUB DIY</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">
          Dinas Perhubungan D.I. Yogyakarta (Dishub DIY)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Otoritas perencana dan pengawas sistem BRT Trans Jogja. Penentuan tarif flat Rp3.600 (umum) dan Rp2.000 (pelajar) berlandaskan <strong>Peraturan Gubernur DIY Nomor 15 Tahun 2020</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="text-slate-500">Cakupan Data:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-keraton-800">Koridor 1A – 5B &amp; Teman Bus</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sumber 2: DJKA Kemenhub -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs hover:border-keraton-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200">
            REGULATOR NASIONAL
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">KEMENHUB RI</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">
          Ditjen Perkeretaapian Kemenhub (DJKA)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Penetapan skema subsidi Kewajiban Pelayanan Publik (PSO) untuk KRL Commuter Line Lin Yogyakarta–Solo dan KA Perintis Prameks (Kutoarjo) dengan tarif flat bersubsidi Rp8.000.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="text-slate-500">Cakupan Data:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-keraton-800">Lin KRL &amp; Subsidi PSO Rel</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sumber 3: KAI Commuter -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs hover:border-keraton-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-50 text-red-800 border border-red-200">
            OPERATOR KOMUTER
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">PT KAI GROUP</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">
          PT Kereta Commuter Indonesia (KAI Commuter)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Operator harian perjalanan KRL Commuter Line di 13 stasiun aktif lintas provinsi DIY–Jawa Tengah. Data jadwal keberangkatan, headway, dan integrasi tiket elektronik (KMT &amp; QR).
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="text-slate-500">Cakupan Data:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-keraton-800">13 Stasiun &amp; Headway Kereta</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sumber 4: PT Railink KAI Bandara -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs hover:border-keraton-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-800 border border-cyan-200">
            OPERATOR BANDARA
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">PT RAILINK</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">
          PT Railink (KAI Bandara YIA)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Pengelola resmi layanan Kereta Api Bandara YIA. Struktur tarif komparasi resmi: KA Bandara Reguler (Rp20.000 via Stasiun Wates) dan KA Bandara Xpress (Rp50.000 non-stop).
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="text-slate-500">Cakupan Data:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-keraton-800">Jadwal &amp; Tarif KA Bandara YIA</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sumber 5: Perum DAMRI -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs hover:border-keraton-400 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200">
            ANGKUTAN WISATA
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">BUMN DAMRI</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1.5">
          Perum DAMRI Cabang Yogyakarta
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Penyelenggara angkutan Kawasan Strategis Pariwisata Nasional (KSPN): rute Candi Borobudur via Terminal Jombor, rute Pantai Selatan/Parangtritis, serta angkutan perintis Sleman–Bantul.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="text-slate-500">Cakupan Data:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-keraton-800">Trayek KSPN &amp; Antarmoda Wisata</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metodologi Verifikasi Lapangan -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-keraton-900 text-white border border-jogja-400/60 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-jogja-300 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase mb-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
            METODOLOGI OBSERVASI E-E-A-T
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm mb-2">
            Protokol Verifikasi Fisik Lapangan
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-keraton-100/90 leading-relaxed">
            Tim redaksi melakukan uji coba langsung: pengetapan kartu (Tap-on-Bus), pencocokan lokasi fisik rambu halte, audit durasi headway di halte transit Tugu &amp; Malioboro, serta konfirmasi penyesuaian operasional.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-keraton-800 text-[10px] font-mono text-jogja-300">
          Status Audit: Terverifikasi Aktif Kuartal IV 2026
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Official Independence Notice -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-500 flex items-start gap-3">
      <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold font-mono text-[10px]">
        i
      </div>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Pernyataan Akurasi &amp; Independensi:</strong> Portal ini beroperasi secara mandiri demi mendukung mobilitas publik masyarakat dan wisatawan di Yogyakarta. Tidak ada afiliasi berbayar dari operator manapun. Bila Anda menemukan perubahan rambu fisik di lapangan yang belum tercatat, silakan laporkan melalui <a href="/kontak" class="text-keraton-800 underline font-semibold">meja redaksi</a> untuk kami verifikasi dalam 1x24 jam kerja.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>
